@startuml

title Advanced Job State Machine (Retries + DLQ + Idempotency)

[*] --> Created

Created --> Queued

Queued --> Processing

Processing --> Completed

Processing --> Failed : exception/error

Failed --> Processing : retry if retryCount < maxRetries

Failed --> DeadLetterQueue : retryCount >= maxRetries

DeadLetterQueue --> ManualIntervention

Completed --> [*]
DeadLetterQueue --> [*]

note right of Processing
Idempotent execution ensured:
- duplicate-safe processing
- safe retry semantics
end note

note right of Failed
Exponential backoff applied:
delay = base * 2^retryCount
end note

@enduml